//pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}, "version": {"name": "lets-go-pikachu", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/31/"}}, {"flavor_text": "Its whiskers provide it with a keen sense of\nsmell, enabling it to pick up the scent of\nhidden food and locate it instantly.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}, "version": {"name": "lets-go-eevee", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/32/"}}]}